  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: MP-1002: you start its worker
  s0 --> s2: MP-1001: you change its code yourself
  s1 --> s3: MP-1002: its worker edits in its worktree
  s2 --> s4: MP-1001: you run its anchor: it passes
  s3 --> s5: MP-1002's worker returns, its check passed: the book does not count it
  s4 --> s6: MP-1001: you send it to the persistent reviewer
  s4 --> s7: MP-1002: you change its code yourself
  s6 --> s8: MP-1002: you change its code yourself
  s8 --> s9: MP-1002: you run its anchor: it passes
  s9 --> s10: the reviewer comes back clear for MP-1001
  s10 --> s5: MP-1001: sb returns its car: you declare back for it
  s5 --> s11: MP-1002: you send it to the persistent reviewer
  s11 --> s5: the reviewer comes back clear for MP-1002
